"catalog.guide.grok.cookie" = "Or use a web session to read the chat bot's time-limited rate limits: sign in to [grok.com](https://grok.com) in your browser, open the developer tools (⌥⌘I), switch to the Network tab and reload, click any request to grok.com, then copy the full Cookie header value into the field above.";
