"settings.grok.localHelp" = "Uses the existing Grok CLI sign-in on this Mac (~/.grok/auth.json) to query quotas — nothing to type. x.ai tokens expire about every 6 hours; when one does, this app launches the local Grok CLI once to refresh it silently and retries, so no manual step is needed. If no Grok CLI is found or the refresh fails, run `grok login` in a terminal, then just click Connect here.";
"settings.claude.localHelp" = "Uses the existing Claude Code sign-in on this Mac to query the 5-hour and weekly limits — nothing to type. Every refresh re-reads the latest sign-in, so tokens Claude Code renews are picked up automatically. If the sign-in has expired, it resumes after the next time you use Claude Code. Not signed in yet? Run `claude` in a terminal and sign in with your Pro or Max account, then click Connect here.";
"settings.workbuddy.localHelp" = "Uses the existing WorkBuddy desktop sign-in on this Mac to query the remaining credits of every resource package — nothing to type. Every refresh re-reads the latest sign-in, so tokens WorkBuddy renews are picked up automatically. If the sign-in has expired, it resumes after the next time you open WorkBuddy. Not signed in yet? Open the WorkBuddy app and sign in, then click Connect here.";
