"catalog.help.github-actions" = "Read GitHub Actions monthly spending with an existing authorized token. Leave organization blank for your personal account, or enter one organization. Actions charges belong to the repository owner, not necessarily the person running a workflow. Unavailable access never means zero.";
"catalog.guide.github-actions.apiKey" = "Paste an existing token already authorized for billing reads; Ammo stores it only in the local Keychain. Personal fine-grained tokens need Plan user permission (read). Organizations need Administration organization permission (read) and the required administrator access. Ammo does not import gh login or expand permissions. Classic-token requirements depend on GitHub's response. Check the [official usage reference](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/billing/usage).";
